#X text 240 83 Analyzes the incoming audio signal and outputs how often
it crosses zero. The result depends on the @mode property: 'count'
outputs the raw number of zero crossings per analysis block \, 'rate'
outputs the zero crossing rate (number of crossings divided by block
size) and 'freq' outputs the zero crossing frequency in hertz. In the
special @clock mode the object outputs a short impulse at each zero
crossing \, which can be used as a trigger.;
